        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He! aRavguangc Poubaomei Zehovah",
            "Seitan rui ata kanglou bam khou hei",
            "Nang nzian loumei nang lat paan khou rui",
            "Thuak pat lou the tuna guang salou o.",
            "",
            "Nangrui nzianloumei lat hei",
            "Alungrui mu lakge poubaomei",
            "Tingkao le kandimei nunrui.",
            "",
            "2. He! Poubaomei nang suaihiam daimei ta",
            "Zaat kathui rui nthukna ningbam diu’",
            "Alau kumna kapma huaibam khou hei",
            "Nang ramgai tei akhou na guanglou o.",
            "",
            "He! Jisu hei akhang e thei",
            "Baihmei kahau nicho Poubaomei",
            "Kagan ‘thui Jisu akhang e.",
            "",
            "3. Tingkum ching-ching neihla mei phuzau ki",
            "Ariu makge zingmei bam ranade",
            "Kandih neihla mei le tikgun daimei,",
            "Phutou sini kaganv tingsaeng makge.",
            "",
            "Akhang mu Jisu nang nade",
            "Tingkum machang khang gai mbu hai-hai",
            "Kau le dih khou kungliangmei e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
